multiCSN manuscript analysis code, copyright 2026 Xu Meng. The accompanying
LICENSE-manuscript contains its MIT license. PIDC implements the R variant
used in that analysis and is identified separately from the original method.

The SCSGL implementation is scSGL, copyright 2021 Abdullah Karaaslanli
<evdilak@gmail.com>, under GPL version 3 or later. Its license is preserved in
